- Company.
- Industry.
- Job role.
- Location.
- Hiring specialization.

## B. Recruiter Profile

Each recruiter profile should have:

- Profile image or initials.
- Recruiter name.
- Designation.
- Company.
- Industry.
- Hiring specialization.
- Relevant job openings.
- Professional profile URL.
- Contact information, only when legitimately available.

