Never automatically send messages without explicit user action.

## D. Saved Recruiters

Create a saved recruiter list.

Users should be able to:

- Save recruiters.
- Remove saved recruiters.
- Search saved recruiters.
- View previous outreach drafts.
- Track outreach status.

Persist information through the existing backend if supported. Otherwise, use a clearly documented temporary local-storage fallback.

